*.egg
MANIFEST
# PyInstaller 自动生成的 spec 是构建产物，默认忽略；
# 但仓库里手写的这两份是要跟踪的（它们现在是打包的唯一事实来源，
# 见 build_exe.py / build_installer.py）。必须写在 *.spec 之后才能重新纳入。
*.spec
!DesktopPet.spec
!DesktopPet_Setup.spec
payload.zip

# PyInstaller
# Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
# before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest

# Installer and temp scripts
mk_lnk_*.vbs

